<title>SINGAPORE: KEPCO tenders to buy 500,000 barrels of July LSWR.</title>
<headline>KEPCO tenders to buy 500,000 barrels of July LSWR.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korean Electric Power Company (KEPCO) has issued a tender to buy one 500,000-barrel cargo of 0.3-percent low sulphur waxy residue (LSWR) for July delivery, a KEPCO source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender, which seeks to buy the cargo for delivery July 18-22 to the ports of Ulsan or Pusan, will close on June 5 and is valid for a day, the source said.</p>
<p>KEPCO last bought 1.2 million barrels of LSWR at $17.70 and $18.25 per barrel for June delivery on a cost-and-freight basis. -- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703571)</p>
